@startuml
!theme plain
title RAC Transparent Application Failover (TAF) Sequence
' Biểu đồ trình tự: Quá trình chuyển lỗi trong suốt của RAC

actor "Client App (JDBC)" as client
box "Oracle RAC Cluster" #LightCyan
participant "Node 1\n(srv_oltp)" as node1
participant "Node 2\n(srv_oltp_backup)" as node2
participant "Oracle Clusterware" as crs
end box

client -> node1 : Connect (SERVICE=srv_oltp)
activate node1
node1 --> client : Connection Established

client -> node1 : UPDATE accounts SET balance = ...
node1 --> client : Success

client -> node1 : SELECT * FROM large_report
note right of node1 : In-flight Query\n(Đang chạy truy vấn)

== Sự cố Máy chủ (Server Crash) ==
destroy node1
crs -> crs : Detects Node 1 Failure\n(Phát hiện Node 1 sập)
crs -> node2 : Start srv_oltp on Node 2\n(Mở dịch vụ trên Node 2)
crs -> client : FAN Event: Node 1 is DEAD\n(Gửi cảnh báo đến Client)

== Transparent Failover (TAF) ==
client -> node2 : TAF: Automatically Reconnect to Node 2
activate node2
node2 --> client : Connection Established
note right of node2 : TAF (TYPE=SELECT) resumes the\nin-flight query from where it left off\n(Tiếp tục chạy câu lệnh SELECT đang dở)
node2 --> client : Return remaining SELECT rows

@enduml
